{title: Breathe on Me, Breath of God}
{artist: Edwin Hatch & Robert Jackson}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 72}

Verse 1
[F]Breathe on me, [Bb]Breath of [F]God: fill [Bb]me with [F]life a[C]new,
that [F]I may [C]love what [Dm]thou dost [Bb]love, and [F]do what [C]thou wouldst [F]do.

Verse 2
Breathe on me, breath of God,
Until my heart is pure,
Until with Thee I will one will, To do and to
endure.

Verse 3
Breathe on me, breath of God,
So shall I never die,
But live with Thee the perfect life Of Thine eternity.
